        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Pemko 72\" Commercial Door Threshold ADA Compliant</b>\r\n<p>\r\nPemko 5\" wide x 72\" long x 1/2\" high door thresholds. These 72 inch long thresholds are made from non rusting extruded aluminum.  Used for double 36\" wide commercial doors. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nField sizable, non-handed. Powder coated finish.  Packaged with installation screws.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Pemko 171A Door Threshold\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 72\" (6 ft.)</li>\r\n<li>Height: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Clear Powder Coated</li>\r\n<li><b>ADA Compliant</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis 72\" threshold is ramped on both sides for easy access (Saddle threshold). For use on either double acting (door swings both ways) or single acting doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** Item Discontinued. </b>Use <a href=\"/products/5-x-1-2-x-72-saddle-threshold-ngp-425-72\"><b>NGP 425-72, 5 x 1/2 x 72 Saddle Threshold</b></a>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
